  "title": "Israeli Strike on Gaza’s Al-Aqsa Hospital and Mass Funerals",
  "summary": "Israeli forces targeted a group of Palestinians near Al-Aqsa Hospital, killing at least one person and injuring several, while Al Jazeera All News reports a broader conflict involving a battle over the site. Hamas claims the strike hit Gaza’s civil security, while Israel asserts it targeted 'terrorists.' Israel has stepped up attacks in Gaza as a cease-fire with Hamas has floundered.",
