      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/04/mass-funeral-gaza-victims-2023-israeli-strike",
      "description": "<p>Remains of 112 victims, including 40 children, recovered from rubble more than two years after residential block was destroyed</p><p>Mourners gathered in central Gaza on Tuesday for a mass funeral for 112 people, including 40 children, who were killed in 2023 in one of the deadliest Israeli strikes of the Gaza war.</p><p>Their bodies could not be recovered until now because of Israel’s continuing strikes, which have slowed, though not halted, since the ceasefire in October.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/04/mass-funeral-gaza-victims-2023-israeli-strike\">Continue reading...</a>",
